      "snippet": {
        "line": 163,
        "text": "def scaledVelocity (ν : ℝ) (u : VelocityField) : VelocityField := rescale (Real.sqrt ν) (Real.sqrt ν)⁻¹ u, i.e. (t,x) ↦ √ν • u (t, (√ν)⁻¹ • x) — this is both u_ν and f_ν"
      }
